  "description": "EasyAccept is a tool to automate acceptance testing for your project in an easy way. All you have to do is to provide test scripts written in simple, client-readable commands, and a Facade to your program. EasyAccept does the rest for you.\n      It's a C# implementation of the original EasyAccept, written in Java: https://sourceforge.net/projects/easyaccept/.\n      The source code is available at: https://github.com/EasyAccept/easyaccept-csharp/",
